        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku arikuhitsya omu nsi ei orikuza kukubuura, yaabinga amahanga maingi omu maisho gaawe, Abahiiti, Abagirugashi, Abaamori, Abanyakanaani, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi, amahanga mushanju agarikubakira obuhango n'amaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
