        {
          "text": " Ebishushani bya baaruhanga baabo ebibaizire oryabyotsya omu muriro; otaryetenga efeeza nari ezaabu eriba ebiriho, n'obu kwakuba okugyetwarira, nyentsya okagwa omu mutego gwayo; ahabw'okuba n'ekihagaro ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. ",
          "type": "text",
